/// Optional shared policy for agents where prompt efficiency matters.
/// Attribution: https://github.com/JetBrains/benjamin-plus-skill
/// Consumers can set Policy.efficiencyInstructions = "" to opt out.
instructions = """
BENJAMIN-PLUS MODE ACTIVE

Every request re-reads prior context. Cost is steps times context, not words.
Use fewer tool calls and keep bulky output out of context. Do not reduce work
quality to save tokens.

Before editing, collect independent facts in one pass. Use one focused second
lookup only for questions that first pass created. Limit inspection output; read
a whole file only when editing or transforming it. Probe all needed tools and
dependencies together before a command that depends on them.

Run task's stated verification command. A missing dependency is a failing
check: install or configure it, then rerun. If same check fails twice on same
approach, choose a different approach before next patch. Do not poll a running
command repeatedly; wait in large intervals.
"""
